{"id":"6e7c6dac50ba7c59","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-dcpo-exponential.md","title":"Dcpo 的指数与逐点上确界","display":"thm-dcpo-exponential — Dcpo 的指数与逐点上确界","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-thm-dcpo-exponential","aliases":["16-thm-dcpo-exponential","16-thm--dcpo-exponential"],"display":"thm-dcpo-exponential — Dcpo 的指数与逐点上确界","depends_on":["[[16-df-cpo]]","[[16-df-dcpo-function-space]]"],"source":"Dcpo CCC statement: Preliminaries p. xvii (PDF 19); §10.6 p. 638 (PDF 658); proof expanded in note","revision_date":"2026-10-15","verification_status":"proved-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-dcpo-exponential"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-dcpo-exponential</span><span>16-thm--dcpo-exponential</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dcpo-exponential — Dcpo 的指数与逐点上确界"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d561a55729f9cdb8\" href=\"?note=d561a55729f9cdb8\" title=\"16-df-cpo\">16-df-cpo</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a101152a4f31cd83\" href=\"?note=a101152a4f31cd83\" title=\"16-df-dcpo-function-space\">16-df-dcpo-function-space</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Dcpo CCC statement: Preliminaries p. xvii (PDF 19); §10.6 p. 638 (PDF 658); proof expanded in note"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-15"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,E,Z\">\\(D,E,Z\\)</span> 为小 dcpo，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[D,E]\">\\([D,E]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ev}\">\\(\\operatorname{ev}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{curry}\">\\(\\operatorname{curry}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{uncurry}\">\\(\\operatorname{uncurry}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a101152a4f31cd83\" href=\"?note=a101152a4f31cd83\" title=\"16-df-dcpo-function-space\">16-df-dcpo-function-space</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\\subseteq[D,E]\">\\(\\mathcal F\\subseteq[D,E]\\)</span> 非空有向；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:Z\\times D\\to E\">\\(h:Z\\times D\\to E\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k:Z\\to[D,E]\">\\(k:Z\\to[D,E]\\)</span> 连续。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 有最小元，记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_E\">\\(\\bot_E\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CPO},\\mathrm{DCPO},\\mathrm{ScottCont}\">\\(\\mathrm{CPO},\\mathrm{DCPO},\\mathrm{ScottCont}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d561a55729f9cdb8\" href=\"?note=d561a55729f9cdb8\" title=\"16-df-cpo\">16-df-cpo</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{DCPO}([D,E],\\leq_{[D,E]}),\\qquad\n(\\forall x\\in D)\\ (\\bigsqcup_{[D,E]}\\mathcal F)(x)=\\bigsqcup_E\\{f(x)\\mid f\\in\\mathcal F\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ScottCont}(\\operatorname{ev}_{D,E},[D,E]\\times D,E),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ScottCont}(\\operatorname{curry}(h),Z,[D,E]),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{ScottCont}(\\operatorname{uncurry}(k),Z\\times D,E),\\\\\n\\operatorname{uncurry}(\\operatorname{curry}(h))=h,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{curry}(\\operatorname{uncurry}(k))=k,\\\\\n\\mathrm{CPO}(E,\\leq_E)\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{CPO}([D,E],\\leq_{[D,E]})\\land\\bot_{[D,E]}=(x\\mapsto\\bot_E)\\bigr).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{DCPO}([D,E],\\leq_{[D,E]}),\\qquad\n(\\forall x\\in D)\\ (\\bigsqcup_{[D,E]}\\mathcal F)(x)=\\bigsqcup_E\\{f(x)\\mid f\\in\\mathcal F\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ScottCont}(\\operatorname{ev}_{D,E},[D,E]\\times D,E),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ScottCont}(\\operatorname{curry}(h),Z,[D,E]),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{ScottCont}(\\operatorname{uncurry}(k),Z\\times D,E),\\\\\n\\operatorname{uncurry}(\\operatorname{curry}(h))=h,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{curry}(\\operatorname{uncurry}(k))=k,\\\\\n\\mathrm{CPO}(E,\\leq_E)\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{CPO}([D,E],\\leq_{[D,E]})\\land\\bot_{[D,E]}=(x\\mapsto\\bot_E)\\bigr).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明：对有向函数族逐点取上确界。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq D\">\\(S\\subseteq D\\)</span> 有向，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{f(x)\\mid f\\in\\mathcal F,x\\in S\\}\">\\(\\{f(x)\\mid f\\in\\mathcal F,x\\in S\\}\\)</span> 有向，两次取上确界可交换，故所得函数仍连续。相同双重上确界论证说明求值连续。柯里化的每个截面连续，且沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 的有向上确界逐点保持；逆柯里化由求值和配对连续得到。两个往返等式逐点成立。常底函数逐点最小。</p>\n<p>来源陈述：Preliminaries, p. xvii (PDF 19)；§10.6, p. 638 (PDF 658)。以上是本笔记补写的证明，不是原书另编号的定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-cpo","status":"resolved","id":"d561a55729f9cdb8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-cpo]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dcpo-function-space","status":"resolved","id":"a101152a4f31cd83","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-dcpo-function-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dcpo-function-space","status":"resolved","id":"a101152a4f31cd83","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D,E,Z$ 为小 dcpo，$[D,E]$、$\\operatorname{ev}$、$\\operatorname{curry}$、$\\operatorname{uncurry}$ 见 [[16-df-dcpo-function-space]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-cpo","status":"resolved","id":"d561a55729f9cdb8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CPO},\\mathrm{DCPO},\\mathrm{ScottCont}$ 采用 [[16-df-cpo]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"D,E,Z","display":false},{"tex":"[D,E]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ev}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{curry}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{uncurry}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F\\subseteq[D,E]","display":false},{"tex":"h:Z\\times D\\to E","display":false},{"tex":"k:Z\\to[D,E]","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot_E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CPO},\\mathrm{DCPO},\\mathrm{ScottCont}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{DCPO}([D,E],\\leq_{[D,E]}),\\qquad\n(\\forall x\\in D)\\ (\\bigsqcup_{[D,E]}\\mathcal F)(x)=\\bigsqcup_E\\{f(x)\\mid f\\in\\mathcal F\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ScottCont}(\\operatorname{ev}_{D,E},[D,E]\\times D,E),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ScottCont}(\\operatorname{curry}(h),Z,[D,E]),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{ScottCont}(\\operatorname{uncurry}(k),Z\\times D,E),\\\\\n\\operatorname{uncurry}(\\operatorname{curry}(h))=h,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{curry}(\\operatorname{uncurry}(k))=k,\\\\\n\\mathrm{CPO}(E,\\leq_E)\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{CPO}([D,E],\\leq_{[D,E]})\\land\\bot_{[D,E]}=(x\\mapsto\\bot_E)\\bigr).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"S\\subseteq D","display":false},{"tex":"\\{f(x)\\mid f\\in\\mathcal F,x\\in S\\}","display":false},{"tex":"Z","display":false}],"bytes":2090,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-49","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-cpo]]、[[16-df-dcpo-function-space]]、[[16-thm-dcpo-exponential]]、[[16-df-embedding-projection]]、[[16-thm-ep-properties]]、[[16-thm-ep-bilimit]]、[[16-thm-inverse-limit]]、[[16-df-lambda-category]]、[[16-thm-domain-model]]。极限构造的完整证明是明示的本地补写；λ-category 按 §2.5 的指定反身对象接口定义。"},{"id":"343cd2798c360ffe","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D$ 为小 dcpo，$\\alpha:D\\to[D,D]$、$\\beta:[D,D]\\to D$ 连续且互逆；函数空间见 [[16-df-dcpo-function-space]]，其指数定理见 [[16-thm-dcpo-exponential]]。"},{"id":"6cb45d716150df5b","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D_0$ 为小的带底 dcpo，$\\bot_0$ 为其最小元；连续函数空间见 [[16-df-dcpo-function-space]] 及 [[16-thm-dcpo-exponential]]。"}],"outgoing":["d561a55729f9cdb8","a101152a4f31cd83"]}